            <h2>Complete the sentence in the Simple Past:</h2>
            <p><em>"Yesterday, I ____ (go) to the market."</em></p>
            <p>The correct answer is:</p>
            <p><strong>went</strong></p>
            <p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>
            <p>
                The verb <strong>"go"</strong> is an irregular verb. In the Simple Past tense, its form is <strong>"went"</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
                Example: <em>Yesterday, I went to the market.</em>
            </p>
